<h1 class="first">1. Executive Summary</h1>
<p>
  <strong>AccBots</strong> is an enterprise-grade web application created to digitize and scale accounting, bookkeeping, UAE FTA tax advisory, corporate auditing, and business registration services. In addition to a high-converting public marketing front-end, the application embeds a full <strong>Client Portal</strong>, an <strong>Administrative Control Suite</strong>, and two sophisticated financial micro-applications: an <strong>Expense Tracker</strong> with cloud receipt attachment and a <strong>Double-Entry Accounting General Ledger (Accounts-Web)</strong> with dynamic Trial Balance and Profit &amp; Loss reporting.
</p>
<p>
  The platform is designed with an uncompromising standard for <strong>vendor independence</strong>, <strong>data integrity</strong>, and <strong>bank-level web security</strong>. Proprietary third-party authentication widgets have been substituted with a custom stateless JSON Web Token (JWT) architecture backed by relational PostgreSQL persistence and SHA-256 session token hashing.
</p>

<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 2 ══════════════════ -->
<h1>2. Technology Stack &amp; Language Distribution</h1>
<p>
  The software architecture leverages modern web technologies selected for strict type safety, fast edge execution, and operational cost-efficiency.
</p>

<table>
